§§ `Refunds and liability — Illustrations`

§§§ `Business-day arithmetic`

-- 2026-09-09 is a Wednesday; one business day later is Thursday the 10th.
#ASSERT `the end of the following business day after` (Date 9 9 2026) EQUALS Date 10 9 2026
-- 2026-09-11 is a Friday; one business day later skips the weekend to Monday.
#ASSERT `the end of the following business day after` (Date 11 9 2026) EQUALS Date 14 9 2026
-- Ten business days from Wednesday 2026-09-09 is Wednesday 2026-09-23.
#ASSERT `business days after` (Date 9 9 2026) 10 EQUALS Date 23 9 2026

§§§ `Article 71 and Article 77 windows`

#ASSERT `deadline to notify an unauthorised transaction` (Date 9 9 2026) EQUALS Date 9 10 2027
#ASSERT `deadline for the payer to request a payee initiated refund` (Date 9 9 2026) EQUALS Date 4 11 2026
#ASSERT `deadline to refund or justify refusal` (Date 9 9 2026) EQUALS Date 23 9 2026
